     xmlns:rdfs="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#"
     xmlns:FDD_ON_VAV_HVAC="http://www.semanticweb.org/y6g/ontologies/2025/FDD_ON_VAV_HVAC#">
    <owl:Ontology rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/y6g/ontologies/2025/FDD_ON_VAV_HVAC">
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="gmail.com.">Developed by Dr. Yimin Chen. Please direct all comments and questions to chenyimincareer</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment>FDD-ON_VAV_HVAC is an sub ontology of FDD-ON, which is an ontology of fault detection and diagnostics (FDD) for heating, ventilation, air conditioning and refrigeration (HVAC&amp;R) systems. This part of the ontology is for Variable Air Volume (VAV) HVAC systems.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Ontology>
    


